      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millbourne%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1909, developers Samuel Shoemaker and John L. Fry built housing that split Millbourne from Upper Darby, leading to its incorporation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26,
