      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millbourne%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Millbourne Station opened in 1907, was fully modernized in 2007, and is decorated with iridescent peacock feathers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        19,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millbourne%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A community mural beside Millbourne Station, visible through a narrow passageway, portrays local residents and their everyday life.",
